<p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>77 Studio LLC</strong>, operating Reviko (“Reviko,” “we,” “us,” or “our”), collects, uses, discloses, stores, and protects personal information.</p>

  <h2>1. Eligibility and Scope</h2>
  <p>Reviko is intended only for individuals who are <strong>18 years of age or older</strong>.</p>
  <p>This Policy applies to Reviko websites, applications, loyalty programs powered by Reviko, digital loyalty passes generated through Reviko, Merchant dashboards, and related services.</p>

  <h2>2. Our Role</h2>
  <p>Reviko is a technology platform serving participating Merchants. Depending on the context, Reviko may process personal information for its own business purposes or on behalf of a Merchant operating a loyalty program.</p>
  <p>Participating Merchants may have their own privacy notices and legal obligations.</p>

  <h2>3. Information We Collect</h2>
  <h3>Customer Information</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>name;</li>
    <li>email address;</li>
    <li>telephone number;</li>
    <li>user identifiers;</li>
    <li>loyalty program membership information.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Loyalty Activity</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>visits;</li>
    <li>points;</li>
    <li>rewards;</li>
    <li>stamps;</li>
    <li>redemption history;</li>
    <li>enrollment dates;</li>
    <li>membership status;</li>
    <li>participating Merchant.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Device and Technical Information</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>IP address;</li>
    <li>browser type;</li>
    <li>operating system;</li>
    <li>device type;</li>
    <li>authentication records;</li>
    <li>security logs;</li>
    <li>access timestamps;</li>
    <li>usage and event information.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Merchant Information</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>business name;</li>
    <li>contact information;</li>
    <li>authorized representatives;</li>
    <li>locations;</li>
    <li>logos and branding;</li>
    <li>loyalty program configuration;</li>
    <li>billing and subscription information.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. How We Use Information</h2>
  <p>We may use information to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>create and manage accounts;</li>
    <li>enroll Customers in loyalty programs;</li>
    <li>operate loyalty memberships;</li>
    <li>record visits, points, and rewards;</li>
    <li>process redemptions;</li>
    <li>issue and update digital loyalty passes;</li>
    <li>authenticate users;</li>
    <li>process subscription payments;</li>
    <li>provide transactional email, SMS, WhatsApp, and other service communications;</li>
    <li>prevent fraud and maintain security;</li>
    <li>provide support;</li>
    <li>manage Merchants;</li>
    <li>perform analytics;</li>
    <li>improve Reviko;</li>
    <li>comply with legal obligations; and</li>
    <li>enforce our agreements.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Service Providers and Technology Partners</h2>
  <p>Reviko currently uses or plans to use service providers that may process information on our behalf, including:</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Provider</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
