  <p>Providers may change as Reviko evolves. We will update this Policy when a material change affects how personal information is handled.</p>

  <h2>6. Apple Wallet and Google Wallet</h2>
  <p>When a Customer chooses to add a loyalty pass to Apple Wallet or Google Wallet, Reviko may provide information necessary to issue, identify, display, manage, or update that pass.</p>
  <p>Apple and Google operate independently and process information under their own privacy policies and terms.</p>

  <h2>7. Merchants</h2>
  <p>Information relating to a Customer’s participation in a Merchant’s loyalty program may be accessible to that Merchant.</p>
  <p>Reviko is designed so unrelated Merchants should not receive access through the platform to Customer data belonging exclusively to another Merchant.</p>

  <h2>8. Messaging</h2>
  <p>Reviko may facilitate email, SMS, WhatsApp, or similar communications.</p>
  <p>Transactional or service communications may be sent as necessary to operate the service. Marketing communications must be supported by applicable consent or another lawful basis and may be subject to Merchant-specific terms.</p>

  <h2>9. Analytics</h2>
  <p>Reviko may use Google Analytics and PostHog to understand product usage, improve performance, diagnose errors, and measure product engagement.</p>
  <p>Where required by applicable law, Reviko will provide appropriate cookie or tracking controls.</p>

  <h2>10. How We Disclose Information</h2>
  <p>We may disclose personal information:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>to the Merchant whose loyalty program the Customer joined;</li>
    <li>to service providers acting on our behalf;</li>
    <li>when required by law or lawful process;</li>
    <li>to protect rights, safety, security, or the integrity of the service; or</li>
    <li>in connection with a merger, financing, acquisition, reorganization, or sale of business assets, subject to applicable law.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>11. Sale of Personal Information</h2>
  <p>Reviko does not intend to operate as a data broker and does not sell Customer personal information as part of its ordinary business model.</p>
  <p>If our practices materially change, we will update this Policy and provide legally required choices.</p>

  <h2>12. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary to provide Reviko, maintain business and security records, prevent fraud, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce agreements.</p>
  <p>Information may then be deleted or de-identified.</p>

  <h2>13. Security</h2>
  <p>Reviko uses reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards designed to protect personal information. No digital system can guarantee absolute security.</p>

  <h2>14. Privacy Rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live and the law that applies, you may have rights to request:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>access to personal information;</li>
    <li>correction;</li>
    <li>deletion;</li>
    <li>portability;</li>
    <li>information about disclosures;</li>
    <li>withdrawal of certain consent;</li>
    <li>opt-out of certain forms of sale, sharing, targeted advertising, or profiling where applicable; and</li>
    <li>review or appeal of certain privacy decisions where required by law.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Requests may be submitted at <a href="/en/privacy-request">https://reviko.io/privacy-request</a> or by emailing <a href="mailto:privacy@reviko.io">privacy@reviko.io</a>.</p>

  <h2>15. California Privacy Rights</h2>
  <p>Where California privacy law applies, California residents may have rights including the Right to Know, Right to Delete, Right to Correct, Right to Opt Out of Sale or Sharing, Right to Limit certain uses of Sensitive Personal Information where applicable, and Right to Non-Discrimination.</p>
  <p>Reviko does not currently intend to sell personal information.</p>

  <h2>16. Account and Data Deletion</h2>
  <p>Users may request deletion at <a href="/en/delete-account">https://reviko.io/delete-account</a> or by contacting <a href="mailto:privacy@reviko.io">privacy@reviko.io</a>.</p>
  <p>We may retain information where reasonably necessary for legal, accounting, fraud prevention, security, dispute resolution, or other lawful purposes.</p>

  <h2>17. International Processing</h2>
  <p>Reviko is operated by a United States company. Information may be processed in the United States or other countries where our service providers operate.</p>

  <h2>18. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
  <p>Reviko may use cookies, local storage, analytics tools, and similar technologies for authentication, security, preferences, product functionality, and analytics.</p>

  <h2>19. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Policy from time to time. Material changes will be communicated through reasonable means.</p>

